{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00436",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.22,
      "end_seconds": 3.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Morning. Just put your bag down anywhere."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 4.44,
      "end_seconds": 7.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Doctor, I'm just here to help with the details."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.25,
      "end_seconds": 13.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit. Did you take the bus in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.79,
      "end_seconds": 18.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Oh, I drove. The roads were quiet today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.47,
      "end_seconds": 19.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Right, what's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.77,
      "end_seconds": 24.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got pain in both knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.36,
      "end_seconds": 33.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.02,
      "text": "So, is this recent, or has it been a while? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.73,
      "end_seconds": 35.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Probably four weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.6,
      "end_seconds": 39.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.09,
      "end_seconds": 42.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.02,
      "end_seconds": 45.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.43,
      "end_seconds": 51.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Swelling in the right knee goes along with it, most of the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.23,
      "end_seconds": 58.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 58.21,
      "end_seconds": 63.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, um, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.27,
      "end_seconds": 70.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "I was getting to that! The swelling in the right knee? That's been for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.93,
      "end_seconds": 74.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Alright, on a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.67,
      "end_seconds": 82.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "Well, you know, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.63,
      "end_seconds": 88.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.84,
      "end_seconds": 92.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.13,
      "end_seconds": 98.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Have you had pain in both knees before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.19,
      "end_seconds": 104.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "I had a similar thing about six months ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.93,
      "end_seconds": 108.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.86,
      "end_seconds": 115.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "So, yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.98,
      "end_seconds": 120.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Have you had any locking of the knee or fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.24,
      "end_seconds": 132.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.97,
      "text": "No, no locking of the knee, no fall. I did have stiffness in the morning at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.68,
      "end_seconds": 135.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Have you had any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.8,
      "end_seconds": 137.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "No, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 138.3,
      "end_seconds": 143.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Well, actually, doctor, I did notice fever. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.61,
      "end_seconds": 149.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.07,
      "end_seconds": 159.95,
      "duration_seconds": 8.88,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Alright, have you had any back pain or pain in other joints?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.46,
      "end_seconds": 165.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "No back pain or pain in other joints, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.73,
      "end_seconds": 169.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "I see. What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.19,
      "end_seconds": 172.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.32,
      "end_seconds": 175.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.87,
      "end_seconds": 178.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.15,
      "end_seconds": 180.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.66,
      "end_seconds": 182.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.12,
      "end_seconds": 187.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Right, do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.69,
      "end_seconds": 209.06,
      "duration_seconds": 20.37,
      "text": "Oh, I have diabetes. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I've had arthritis in my knees for nearly five years now. I took the morning off to come in today. I've had high blood pressure, yes. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.78,
      "end_seconds": 214.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known arthritis in my knees. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.7,
      "end_seconds": 218.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.3,
      "end_seconds": 220.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.45,
      "end_seconds": 233.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.65,
      "end_seconds": 242.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "Yeah, yes, I had a hernia repair, about five years back. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.01,
      "end_seconds": 248.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.5,
      "end_seconds": 251.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.39,
      "end_seconds": 255.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.67,
      "end_seconds": 258.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "My father had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.78,
      "end_seconds": 262.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.72,
      "end_seconds": 265.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Glimepiride, 2 milligrams, maybe, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.29,
      "end_seconds": 268.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.75,
      "end_seconds": 276.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. Amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 276.82,
      "end_seconds": 284.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "I mean, doctor, I think the last prescription for the amlodipine was 10 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.94,
      "end_seconds": 287.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.86,
      "end_seconds": 295.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I'm on paracetamol, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.82,
      "end_seconds": 298.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.57,
      "end_seconds": 302.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "500 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.52,
      "end_seconds": 306.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.49,
      "end_seconds": 316.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.75,
      "end_seconds": 359.51,
      "duration_seconds": 25.76,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.7, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, heart rate 78. And BP is 124 over 81. From what you've told me, it fits best with osteoarthritis of the knees. The reason I say that is that the way you describe it fits together. I'd also keep a meniscal problem in mind. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in both knees for four weeks, mild, and no back pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.92,
      "end_seconds": 362.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Uh, exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.48,
      "end_seconds": 370.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange blood tests for joint pain. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.26,
      "end_seconds": 372.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.89,
      "end_seconds": 377.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "We should do an X-ray of both knees for knee pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.22,
      "end_seconds": 379.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.06,
      "end_seconds": 388.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "I'd like you to take etoricoxib, 60 milligrams, once a day, for five days. You take it by mouth. That's for knee pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.73,
      "end_seconds": 390.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.83,
      "end_seconds": 414.55,
      "duration_seconds": 22.72,
      "text": "Losing even a few kilos takes a lot of load off the knees, and I'd like you to do the strengthening exercises. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 415.58,
      "end_seconds": 422.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 423.57,
      "end_seconds": 426.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Okay, you know, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 426.83,
      "end_seconds": 435.28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.45,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Let's review you in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 436.2,
      "end_seconds": 438.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Oh, okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0073",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 439.63,
      "end_seconds": 443.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0074",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 444.26,
      "end_seconds": 446.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "No, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0075",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 448.05,
      "end_seconds": 448.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}